{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IM8ahtbYpB1794796305.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價連升3天，繼續見逾4年高位。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.7088，較上個交易日上調23點子，是自2022年7月11日以來的高位。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價早段都於6.66水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展6,170億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，以及5,000億元人民幣7天期逆回購操作。扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放6,010億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>而為保持銀行體系流動性充裕，人行同日開展8,000億元人民幣中期借貸便利(MLF)操作，期限為1年，較本月到期量減少2,000億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T04:23:52.956367+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T02:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T17:17:34.763672+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T04:17:14.513461+00:00","content_hash":"9d96367056b330dd927e8b104dbaa895c9cdc324b626fe379d245914776d10eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T04:23:52.956367+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}